# Only what the build reads (the same set as nix/package.nix), so docs, e2e and
# the 160 MB Nomir export never reach the build context.
# e2e/package.json stays: the lockfile lists it as a workspace project.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps
!packages
!e2e/package.json

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.data
**/*.sqlite*
**/.DS_Store
